{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/9e537cdd8d63c3e7011a48cd36aea657.avif?t=1764345611\" width=432 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopward is a vertical precision platformer set in a whimsical yet punishing world of pure vertical challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a determined little frog with one goal: <strong>reach the top</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with only a <strong>chargeable jump</strong> and a <strong>mid-air dive</strong>, you'll conquer a towering world of tricky platforms and mystical zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No shortcuts. No checkpoints. <strong>No Autosaves\u2014unless you earn them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall, learn, and hop again.</strong><br><strong>Each fall hurts. Each jump counts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/bf03563fdcceab685b7bcb7b82e49087.poster.avif?t=1764345611\" width=620 height=295 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/bf03563fdcceab685b7bcb7b82e49087.webm?t=1764345611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/7eef69b6184d240346ba7dadc65e4979.avif?t=1764345611\" width=432 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold to charge, release to Hop. 